Zikom
$cards
DECK 4 SPADES

$initial
DRAW 29 DEAL TADID
TADID 8 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
TADID 7 FACE_LAST
TADID 8 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE TADID TADID
DESTSRC Rank equal
MOVE_STACK TADID TADID
OR
    DEST Rank 1
    SRC Suit {SPADES, HEARTS, DIAMONDS}
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
